<title>USA: FiberMark sets three-for-two stock split.</title>
<headline>FiberMark sets three-for-two stock split.</headline>
<dateline>BRATTLEBORO, Vt. 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>FiberMark Inc said it declared a three-for-two stock split, effective May 13, 1997, for shareholders of record at the close of business on May 6, 1997.</p>
<p>The company said the split will increase its common shares outstanding shares to about 6.1 million from about 4.0 million.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610))</p>
